---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Writing">
  <section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The notebook</p><h1>Thinking <em>out loud.</em></h1><p>Notes on making things, understanding them, and following a question a little further.</p></section>
  <section class="empty-notebook" aria-labelledby="notebook-empty-title"><div class="notebook-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><p class="eyebrow">The first page is still ahead</p><h2 id="notebook-empty-title">A little space for<br /><em>what comes next.</em></h2><p>No published pieces just yet. In the meantime, take a look at what’s taking shape.</p><a class="text-link" href={`${base}projects/`}>Explore the projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
